# The PlayStation's track without a MIDI driver (fixtures/psvolumes: the
# lba.cfg of sound, MidiDriver NoMidi, with MusicJingles: PlayStation,
# and the outside save, on the CD psmusic). The save loads and its
# scene's tune 19 plays as J09MID. F6 opens the option menu, whose CD
# tune fades the recording, and Volume settings plays tune 9 from the
# CD, which stops it as it stops the XMIDI. Return to previous menu,
# then Return to game, one entry up as the menu keeps its choice, and
# the scene's tune plays again.
hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 10
shot playing
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Return
sleep 4
shot volumes
key Return
sleep 3
shot options2
key Up Return
sleep 5
shot back
